==Strategy==
Can be beaten with Evolved Forms of [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]]. [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] will be a great help in this stage due to their extra damage against [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red enemies]].

When the battle begins spam your [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]. When your meatshields start hitting the enemy base, spawn your anti-red units.

Alternatively, you can still rush this stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]].

